for how far away from the edge to start scrolling really
high, like 20 or so, keeps the player character pretty much
in the center of the screen, and so provides plenty of
context; you almost never _must_ see the whole level at
once.

The big tiles I'm using are for the MS-Windows version, I
don't have the least clue about whether the same ones work
for other versions.

